              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/paracompact+manifold"} paracompact
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+manifold"} smooth manifold
              admits a differentiably good open cover.
          .proof
            %h6#proof Proof
            %p
